    "parts": {
      "when": "[Opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after an enemy unit picks its targets.",
      "target": "A **DEATH GUARD** unit of yours that is a target of any of that enemy unit's attacks, and a **POXWALKERS** unit of yours up to 3\" from it that both it and the attacking unit can see.",
      "effect": "Whenever an attack would be allocated to a model in the **DEATH GUARD** unit, if the attacking model can see the **POXWALKERS** unit and could pick it as a target for that attack, make no [saving throw](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls) for that attack. Instead, destroy as many **POXWALKERS** models in the **POXWALKERS** unit as the attack's D. This lasts for the rest of the phase."
    },
